   "$comment": "45 emoji: compact clips at 40, tree at 30. UTF-16 take(40) would keep only 20 emoji on the Kotlin side while Swift's grapheme prefix kept 40 — and a UTF-16 clip can split a surrogate pair. Both sides clip by code point.",
